    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/1"/>To You, we pour out our hearts and souls
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/2"/>like water,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/3"/>all of us—to the Almighty in heaven.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/4"/>Come, you old, with your young,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/5"/>cleanse yourselves,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/6"/>and remove your sinfulness.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/7"/>Let us multiply before Him
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/8"/>[our] supplication and prayer,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/9"/>and this we ask of our God:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/10"/>That the good [inclination]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/11"/>prevail over the corrupt [one],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/12"/>that he forsake his way—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/13"/>the transgressor and evildoer.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/14"/>Prepare your heart and amend your thoughts
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/15"/>for great is the power of repentance.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/16"/>In the assembly of people
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/17"/>let us multiply words [of prayer]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/18"/>and the mighty God will not abhor them.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/19"/>He desires the return of the corrupt sinner,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/20"/>to save his soul from destruction [Gehinnom].
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/21"/>Hear [our] supplication
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/22"/>and accept those who beseech You,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/23"/>as we lift up our hands
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/24"/>toward Your Holy Dwelling.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/25"/>May the words of our mouth
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/26"/>be acceptable [before You],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/27"/>and atone our sins,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/28"/>both the involuntary and the intentional.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/29"/>Consider and remember
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/30"/>the call of Your pleasant ones,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/31"/>and relent of the evil against Your people.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/32"/>Grant the desire of Your servants,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/33"/>and let them delight in Your comfort.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/34"/>They rely on Your kindliness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_lev_venefesh_nishpokh_kamayim/35"/>and trust in Your compassion.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
